{"id":"vod_bf_19757","vodId":"19757","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"恋爱禁止的世界","name_cn":"恋爱禁止的世界","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-20/88bf3b0cf00d28a49752d65c7ac9ec6c.jpg"},"summary":"故事的舞台设定在未来的日本，为了解决少子化的问题，政府禁止了自由恋爱，改为由政府全面接管的状态。每一个青少年长到16岁，便会由政府分配一名伴侣作为恋爱的对象，这是经过了精密的计算所匹配出的最佳人选。根岛由佳吏（逢坂良太 配音）是一名十五岁的少年，无论是性格还是样貌都非常普通的他内心隐藏了一个秘密，那就是他从小学期就默默的喜欢着名叫高崎美咲（花泽香菜 配音）的少女，然而，这份爱恋在这个扭曲的社会里却是违法的。　　真田莉莉奈（牧野由衣 配音）是政府分配给根岛由佳吏的完美女友，然而，当她得知了根岛和美咲之间的感情后，决定帮他们隐瞒秘密，全力的支持这份美好而又纯洁的恋情。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 00:34:24","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianaijinzhideshijie/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianaijinzhideshijie/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianaijinzhideshijie/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianaijinzhideshijie/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianaijinzhideshijie/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianaijinzhideshijie/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianaijinzhideshijie/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianaijinzhideshijie/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianaijinzhideshijie/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianaijinzhideshijie/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianaijinzhideshijie/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lianaijinzhideshijie/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:30:37.094Z"}